Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Tu vida es un espejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.89,0:00:01.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y le estás enseñando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:02.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}tu puta peor cara
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:04.25,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Si te levantas despeinado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:05.17,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}¿peinas el espejo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:05.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}o te peinas tú?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:06.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Parece una tontería
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:06.98,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:07.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}es lo que tú haces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:09.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cada día cuando quieres
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:09.84,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que cambie tu vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}sin cambiar tú
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.32,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo es como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:12.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}la vida y solamente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.88,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te puede devolver aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:14.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que le enseñas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.24,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Fulano quiere estar mejor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.15,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero se pasa todo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:18.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}el día agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:19.85,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia y quejándose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.03,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mirando lo que le falta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:21.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de si la gente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.37,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si sus compañeros
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:24.36,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que si el trabajo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:24.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de que esto está muy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.95,0:00:25.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}caro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.25,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Quiere que su vida cambie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:26.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}pero llega a casa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:27.82,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y le muestra la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:28.93,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien desesperado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:29.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de alguien agobiado
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:30.73,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de mala hostia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:32.38,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y la vida simplemente refleja
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:32.90,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}eso mismo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:34.19,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Pero Mengano pilló el juego
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:35.13,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a aplicarlo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:35.84,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}a su favor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:36.91,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Empezó a cuidarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.21,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}empezó a hablarse bien
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:38.83,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y empezó a dejar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:39.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de quejarse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.61,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por lo que la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.30,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no le daba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.30,0:00:42.44,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y empezó a comportarse como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.44,0:00:43.87,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}alguien que se siente capaz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:44.59,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y que ya se siente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:45.29,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}suficiente
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:46.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Y el espejo no tuvo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:48.63,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}más remedio que devolverle esa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:49.40,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}misma imagen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:50.33,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El espejo o la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:51.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}no entienden nada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:52.50,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}simplemente te reflejan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:53.65,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y te devuelven todo aquello
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.65,0:00:54.72,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que tú das y emanas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.20,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Por tanto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.11,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cambia por dentro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:56.87,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y lo de fuera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.87,0:00:57.66,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}se tiene que adaptar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:58.48,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}por consecuencia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:00:59.01,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Así que hoy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:00:59.94,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}cada vez que te pilles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:00.51,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}quejándote
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.51,0:01:01.42,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Cámbialo por algo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.65,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que realmente agradezcas
